# Batch [E] (0.5.2): from gen1-style-batch-e.md. Punk-funk's and Acid techno's bass riffs are held for 8 bars
# (SFX_HOLD in gen.c); Classic disco opens each phrase with the harp run (SFX_HARP).

style PUNKFUNK
kick     X... ..x. X... .x..
snare    .... X... .... X..o
chat     x... x... x... x...
ohat     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.
cowbell  x.xx .x.x x.xx .x.x
conga    .... ..x. .x.. ..x.

style ACIDTECH
kick     X... X... X... X...
clap     .... X... .... X...
rim      .... ...x .... .x..
chat     xx.x xx.x xx.x xx.x
ohat     ..X. ..X. ..X. ..X.

style DISCO
kick     X... X... X... X...
snare    .... X... .... X...
chat     x..x x..x x..x x..x
ohat     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.
conga    .x.. ...x .x.. ..x.
